n6 Shri Bhupinder Singh Bhalla, Shareholder Director Member\n4.11.2 Details of meetings:\nThe Committee held 3 meetings during the period from 01.04.2025 to 31.03.2026 as detailed below:\nNumber of Directors Attended the\nSl. No. Date of meeting Number of Directors on the Share\nTransfer Committee\nmeeting\n1 10.06.2025 6 6\n2 15.12.2025 6 5\n3 23.03.2026 6 5\n4.12 Credit Approval Committee of the Board:\nThe Credit Approval Committee was constituted on 04.04.2012 by the Bank as per the Government of India Notification\nS.O.2736(E) dated 05.12.2011 to be a sanctioning body below MCB to exercise such powers delegated to it by Board\nwith regard to credit proposals / compromise proposals / write off proposals within the framework spelt out by\nGovernment of India. The Committee was reconstituted from time to time.\n4.12.1 Composition of the Credit Approval Committee of the Board:\nThe Composition of Credit Approval Committee as on 31.03.2026 were as under:\nSl. No. Name Chairman/Member\n1 Shri Binod Kumar, MD & CEO Chairman\n2 Shri Ashutosh Choudhury, Executive Director Member\n3 Shri Shiv Bajrang Singh, Executive Director Member\n4 Shri Brajesh Kumar Singh, Executive Director Member","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c766","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":352,"text":"4 Shri Brajesh Kumar Singh, Executive Director Member\n2025-26 वाार्षिVिक रिRपाेे(र्टट Annual Report\n5 Ms. Mini T M, Executive Director Member\n6. Chief General Manager/ General Manager (Corporate Credit) Member\n7. General Manager (CFO) Member\n8. CGMs / GMs / DHs presenting the Credit / Expenditure / other proposals) Member\n9. General Manager (CRO) and CCO, Attendees\n4.12.2 Details of meetings:\nThe Credit Approval Committee held 45 meetings during the period from 01.04.2025 to 31.03.2026, as detailed below:\nSl. No. Date of Meeting Number of WTDs on the Credit\napproval Committee 