tails of meetings:\nNo meeting of the committee was held during the period from 01.04.2025 to 31.03.2026.\n4.14 HR Committee:\nThe HR Committee of the Board was constituted on June 29, 2012 to discuss and decide upon critical issues in HR every quarter. The committee is reconstituted from time to time.\n4.14.1 Composition of the HR Committee:\nThe members of the HR Committee of the Board as on 31.03.2026 were as under:\nSl. No. Name Chairman/Member","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c768","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":353,"text":"Sl. No. Name Chairman/Member\n1 Shri Binod Kumar, MD & CEO Chairman\n2 Shri Ashutosh Choudhury, Executive Director Member\n2025-26 वाार्षिVिक रिRपाेे(र्टट Annual Report\n3 Shri Shiv Bajrang Singh, Executive Director Member\n4 Shri Brajesh Kumar Singh, Executive Director Member\n5 Ms. Mini T M, Executive Director Member\n6 Dr. Alok Pande, GOI Nominee Director Member\n7 Shri Vishvesh Kumar Goel, Part time Non Official Director Member\n4.14.2 Details of meetings:\nThe Committee met 6 times during the period from 01.04.2025 to 31.03.2026 as detailed below:\nSl. No. Date of meeting Number of Directors on HR Committee Number of Directors Attended\nthe meeting\n1 19.05.2025 8 8\n2 16.06.2025 8 8\n3 24.07.2025 7 7\n4 15.09.2025 7 7\n5 14.11.2025 7 7\n6 03.02.2026 7 6\n4.15 Review Committee for Wilful Defaulters:\nReview Committee for Wilful Defaulters was constituted on 23.01.2015. The Committee will review the orders of the\nScreening Committee identifying borrowers as wilful defaulters. The Committee was reconstituted from time to time.\n4.15.1 Composition of the Review Committee of Willful Defaulters:\nThe members of the Review Committee of Willful Defaulters as on 31.03.2026 were as under:\nSl. No. Name Chairman/Member\n1 Shri Binod Kumar, MD & CEO Chairman\n2 Shri Vishvesh Kumar Goel, Part time Non Official Director Member\n3 Shri Sanjeev Maheshwari, Shareholder Director Member\n4.15.2 Details of meetings:","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c769","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":354,"text":"4.15.2 Details of meetings:\nThe Committee met 4 times during the period from 01.04.2025 to 31.03.2026 as detailed below:\nNumber of Directors Attended\nSl. No. Date of meeting Number of Directors on Review Committee of Willful Defaulters\nthe meeting\n1 22.04.2025 3 3\n2 12.08.2025 3 3\n3 15.12.2025 3 3\n4 11.02.2026 3 3\n4.16 Committee for Monitoring of Recovery:\nThe Committee for Monitoring of Recovery was constituted on 18.12.2012 by the Bank for the purpose of monitoring\nthe progress made by the Bank in NPA recovery and to review the functioning of various Committees such as Sale of\nAssets Committee (SAC) and other field level functionaries in the Bank. The Committee was reconstituted from time\nto time.\n2025-26 वाार्षिVिक रिRपाेे(र्टट Annual Report\n4.16.1 Composition of the Committee for Monitoring of Recovery:\nThe members of Committee for Monitoring of Recovery as on 31.03.2026 were as under:\nSl. No. Name Chairman/Member\n1 Shri Binod Kumar, MD & CEO Chairman\n2 Shri Ashutosh Choudhury, Executive Director Member\n3 Shri Shiv Bajrang Singh, Executive Director Member\n4 Shri Brajesh Kumar Singh, Executive Director Member\n5 Ms. Mini T M, Executive Director Member\n6 Dr. Alok Pande, GOI Nominee Director Member\n7 Shri Balmukund Sahay, Part time Non Official Director Member\n8 Shri Vishvesh Kumar Goel, Part time Non Official Director Member\n4.16.2 Details of meetings:","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c770","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":355,"text":"4.16.2 Details of meetings:\nThe Committee held 4 meetings during the period from 01.04.2025 to 31.03.2026 as detailed below:\nNumber of Directors Attended the\nSl. No. Date of meeting Number of Directors on the committee\nfor Monitoring of Recovery\nmeeting\n1 15.05.2025 8 7\n2 28.08.2025 7 7\n3 12.12.2025 8 7\n4 10.02.2026 8 6\n4.17 Committee of Directors (Capital Raising):\nCommittee of Directors (Capital Raising) was constituted as per approval of the Board of Directors in its meeting held\non 28.10.2024. The functions of the committee includes:\n• To approve mode/type of issue, amount of the Issue, timing, proportion, basis of allotment and issue price in\ncompliance with applicable SEBI, RBI, and other applicable laws, Rules and Regulations and within the overall\nlimit approved by the Board of Directors for raising equity capital;\n• To approve appointment of Lead Managers, Legal Advisors, Underwriters (as may be necessary) and all such\nAgencies /Intermediaries as may be required, to enter into and execute all such arrangements/ agreements etc.\nwith such Agencies/Intermediaries and to do all such acts, deeds, matters and things as may be necessary and\nexpedient for issuance of Equity Shares;\n• To approve /finalize the quantum of capital to be raised through issuance of Basel III Compliant AT1/Tier 2 Bonds","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c771","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":355,"text":"• To approve /finalize the quantum of capital to be raised through issuance of Basel III Compliant AT1/Tier 2 Bonds\nin one or more tranches, coupon, maturity, call option, timing, basis of allotment, allotment date and all pre-\nissue/post-issue formalities, modification in terms and conditions of issuance of Bonds, appointment of Rating\nAgency/Trustee, Arrangers/Advisors, intermediaries, Registrar to the Issue and other requisite Intermediaries\nand to do all such acts, deeds, matters and things as may be necessary and expedient for issuance AT1/Tier 2\nBonds.\n2025-26 वाार्षिVिक रिRपाेे(र्टट Annual Report\n4.17.1 Composition of the Committee of Directors for Capital Raising:\nThe members of Committee of Directors for Capital Raising as on 31.03.2026 were as under:\nSl. No. Name Chairman/Member\n1 Shri Binod Kumar, MD & CEO Chairman\n2 Shri Ashutosh Choudhury, Executive Director Member\n3 Shri Shiv Bajrang Singh, Executive Director Member\n4 Shri Brajesh Kumar Singh, Executive Director Member\n5 Ms. Mini T M, Executive Director Member\n4.17.2 Detail of Meeting:\nThe Committee held 2 meetings during the period from 01.04.2025 to 31.03.2026 as detailed below:\nNumber of Directors Attended\nSl. No. Date of meeting No. of Directors on Committee of\nDirector for Capital Raising\nthe meeting\n1 31.10.2025 4 3\n2 11.12.2025 5 3\n5. Senior Management :","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c772","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":356,"text":"5. Senior Management :\n(a) Particulars of Senior Management (Chief General Manager/ Functional Head) as on 31.03.2026 is as under:\nSl. No. Name Designation\n1. Shri Satish Kumar Chief General Manager, Corporate Credit and Mid Corporate Credit\n2. Ms. V. N. Maya Chief General Manager (CDO & CLO) & Legal\n3. Deepak Sarda Chief General Manager,IT & Partnership (Chief Technology Officer / Chief Information Officer)\n4. Ms. Vallery Rath Chief General Manager, TMO & Digital Business, Planning & Business Intelligence, Marketing & Corporate Communication\n5. Shri Sujay Mallik Chief General Manager, Retail Assets & MSME\n6. Shri Sudhir Kumar Gupta Chief General Manager, FGM Lucknow\n7. Shri Sukh Sagar Prasad Roy Chief General Manager, BOD, Estate, ES to MD & CEO & Secretary to Board\n8. Shri Ashok Patnaik Chief General Manager, R&GR\n9. Shri Ram Kumar Das Chief General Manager (CCO)\n10. Shri G Rajeswara Reddy Chief General Manager (Recovery)\n11. Shri Navin Kumar Shrivast