ent) 18.89\n2025-26 वाार्षिVिक रिRपाेे(र्टट Annual Report\nNo disclosure is required in respect of related parties, which are “State-controlled Enterprises” as per paragraph 9 of","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c963","section":"Balance Sheet","tag":"balance","page":459,"text":"No disclosure is required in respect of related parties, which are “State-controlled Enterprises” as per paragraph 9 of\nAccounting Standard (AS) 18. Further, in terms of paragraph 5 of AS 18, transactions Banker-Customer relationship have\nnot been disclosed including those with Key Management Personnel and relatives of Key Management Personnel.\n21. Earnings Per Share (AS 20)\nParticulars 2025-26 2024-25\nNet Profit after tax available for equity shareholders (` Crore) 12155.65 10918.29\nNumber of Equity Shares 1346963981 1346963981\nWeighted Number of equity shares 1346963981 1346963981\nBasic Earnings Per Share (in `) 90.24 81.06\nDiluted earnings per share (in `) 90.24 81.06\nNominal value per Equity Share (in `) 10.00 10.00\n22. Accounting for taxes on income (AS 22):\na) Current Tax: Provision for income tax for domestic operations made during the current year amounts to\nRs.4608.53 Crore including provision for tax relating to earlier years made in the current year amounts to Rs.14.18\nCrores. Provision for income tax made in foreign branches during the current year amounts to Rs.27.86 Crore.\nThe current tax has been calculated in accordance with the provisions of Income Tax Act 1961.\nb) Deferred Tax: The Bank has a net DTA of Rs.5468.52 Crore (Previous year net DTA of Rs.5080.20 Crore), which","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · FY2026","document_date":null,"document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c964","section":"Balance Sheet","tag":"balance","page":459,"text":"b) Deferred Tax: The Bank has a net DTA of Rs.5468.52 Crore (Previous year net DTA of Rs.5080.20 Crore),